 \section{Discussion, limitations, and falsification}
 The ledger is falsified by an arithmetic counterexample under the stated additive model or by failed exact replay. Its ecological interpretation fails when services are non-substitutable, differently scaled, nonlinear, delayed, conditional on abundance, correlated, spatially inaccessible, or jointly lost. Competition, adaptation, network rewiring, partner quality, and temporal turnover are excluded.
